text-unit.text:
For tables, you should include the command that will identify the header row, which would typically be the first row: 

 \tagpdfsetup{table/header-rows={1}}

.

For equations, you should compile with LuaLaTeX if possible to generate the MathML. If you compile with LuaLaTeX and include the 

 tagging-setup={math/setup=mathml-SE}

 option, MathML versions of the equations will be added into the tagged PDF directly.
